entries[250022] = { ["name"] = "Seedpods of the Luminous Bloom", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Leather\n9 Armor\n+7 [Agility or Intellect]\n+10 Stamina\n+ 5 Critical Strike\n+ 9 Mastery\nClasses: Druid\nSprouts of the Luminous Bloom (0/5)\nTrunk of the Luminous Bloom\nArbortenders of the Luminous Bloom\nBranches of the Luminous Bloom\nPhloemwraps of the Luminous Bloom\nSeedpods of the Luminous Bloom\n(2) Set Balance: Shooting Stars deal 50% more damage and generate 3 additional Astral Power outside Eclipse.\n(2) Set Feral: Gaining Clearcasting from Omen of Clarity increases your chance to critically strike by 5% for 4 sec.\n(2) Set Guardian: [ Raze / Maul] and Ravage damage increased by 10%. Moonfire damage increased by 10%.\n(2) Set Restoration: Wild Growth healing increased by 25%.\n(4) Set Balance: Starfall and Starsurge damage increased by 5% and casting them has a 40% chance to strike an affected target with an exploding Shooting Star that also deals (13.6% of Spell Power) Astral damage to all nearby enemies. (100ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Feral: Rake damage increased by 20%. Clearcasting increases Shred or Swipe damage by an additional 15%.\n(4) Set Guardian: [ Raze / Maul] and Ravage have a 5% chance to activate Galactic Guardian. Moonfire's periodic damage has a chance to make your next [ Raze / Maul] or Ravage strike again at 100% effectiveness.\n(4) Set Restoration: Wild Growth cooldown reduced by 2 sec, and mana cost reduced by 10%.\nSell Price:" }
